; Tomahawk (BGM-109 Block V), TASK-141a. US Navy land-attack cruise missile, not in the Polish arsenal: arrives only as allied stock (start stock 0). Numbers [ASSUMPTION], subsonic like Storm Shadow. Range above the map: 'anywhere on the operation map'.
; Real range 1600 km / 5 km per hex = 320 hexes. Accuracy, interceptability, damage, salvo,
; stock and resupply are [ASSUMPTION]s balanced by TASK-103. `platform` is flavour only.

